recommend keep-going the width boundary in glow/rune_shape.rye -- five published usize fields and five accessors move to u32, and the 16 casts in lower_shape.rye and 17 in lower_named_cast.rye fall out, both already gated at zero authored usize on the 45-module roster. Measured and waiting: 19 flagged lines in rune_shape.rye, 2 in nest_type.rye. %282 stays OPEN and is now the macOS bench's to close -- all four subscribe-poll witnesses are GREEN on this pier, and whether the socket-option repair cures BindFailed at rebind cannot be proven from the Linux side. Gated and unchanged: %230, %252, %255, %281, the 59 gate fixtures, and the gating policy for parity_ch01 that %289 surfaces.
